 girl is always full of energy. She loves cute stuff. Kouji thinks of her as his little sister since she's one year younger than him. She promised herself she would do anything for him when he was hit by a car, trying to protect her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12014"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe28349505c806339097ee486084a0ae42d5929260d3333f24d50e291d251749.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9bd5496df42af5c414cb6dc9359eefc24181710c6c53d5d3ab652567fc740173.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42431","characterName":"三津邑 愛里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42431"},"originalCharacterName":"三津邑 愛里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c324336c12db51ae94b159a2e09ccf867311cd328b9f0c49c0f59f25ce03c68c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71786533fba44691af3d7ae46fb2515a522b7ad24f86679261ce00fc9344d84d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p89","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:210","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p89","name":"トラヴュランス","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:2756:210","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p89","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p89","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p89","name":"トラヴュランス","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:24758:v10388","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p